=== gerrIntro ===
Harbrook looks you over for a moment before smiling warmly.

"I'd love to give you that chance."

-> ending

=== blanIntro ===
Abeth Harbrook purses her eyebrows together, and you can almost see her shrug.

"Sure. Come on in," she says, and you follow her into her office.

-> ending


